WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 d4b8c72f7a92dfb1d6fb4eb412fdc752

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.469
Karibu tena. Sasa tumeangalia vitanzi viwili,

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:06.580
kitanzi cha repeat na for of kitanzi.

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:08.109
Katika somo hili, tutaangalia

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.940
vitanzi viwili zaidi na mbinu mbili muhimu za

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.140
vitanzi. Sasa, huenda unakumbuka nilitaja

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.980
mwanzoni kabisa kwamba kitanzi cha repeat

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:18.690
hakipo hasa katika JavaScript. Ni kitu tu

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:20.340
nilichoongeza ili kufanya maisha yako kuwa

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:23.190
rahisi kidogo tunapoanza. Kwa hiyo tunatumia

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.580
nini badala yake? Basi, tunatumia

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:28.150
for kitanzi cha kawaida, na kinaonekana hivi.

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:30.920
Natumaini unaweza kuona kwa nini hilo

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:32.940
lingeweza kutisha kidogo siku yako

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:35.120
ya kwanza. Lakini sasa unayo

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:37.280
maarifa yote unayohitaji ili kuzoea hili.

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:40.340
Hebu tukichambue. for kitanzi

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:44.620
kina sehemu tatu: sehemu ya kuanzia, sharti, na

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:49.769
nyongeza. Sehemu ya kuanzia, hii let i = 0,

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:52.220
sehemu hii inaendeshwa mwanzoni mwa

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:54.920
kitanzi kizima. Inaendeshwa mara moja tu, na

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:58.240
hapa inaunda sanduku linaloitwa i

00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:02.520
lililowekwa kuwa sifuri. Sehemu inayofuata, sharti,

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:08.600
huendeshwa kila mara kabla ya kila marudio ya kitanzi. Kama

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:11.100
sharti ni kweli, tunaendesha kitanzi

00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:15.580
tena. Kama si kweli, hatuendeshi. Na

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:18.580
mwisho ni nyongeza, i++.

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:21.420
Sasa, i++ ina maana sawa

00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:24.420
na i = i + 1. Ni kifupi

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:26.880
tu, njia ya kuongeza i kwa

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:31.200
moja kila mara. Kwa hiyo katika mfano huu,

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:34.200
tutaweka i kuwa sifuri. Tunakagua kama i

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:36.300
ni ndogo kuliko mbili, na ni kweli,

00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:38.360
kwa hiyo tunaendesha kitanzi. Na kisha

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:41.640
mwishoni, tunaongeza i kwa moja, kwa hiyo

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:44.380
i inakuwa moja. Sifuri jumlisha moja ni moja.

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:47.400
Kisha tunaenda tena. Tunakagua kama

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:50.780
moja ni ndogo kuliko mbili. Ni ndogo, kwa hiyo

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:52.580
tunaendesha kitanzi. Na kisha

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:55.140
mwishoni, tunaongeza i tena. Kwa hiyo sasa ni

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:58.300
mbili, moja jumlisha moja ni sawa na mbili. Na kisha

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:00.440
tunaenda mara ya tatu. Wakati huu

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:02.970
tunakagua kama mbili ni ndogo kuliko mbili, na

00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:05.680
sivyo, kwa hiyo hatuendeshi kitanzi,

00:02:05.780 --> 00:02:07.140
na kwa kweli tumemaliza na kitanzi.

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:10.539
Tunaendelea tu na msimbo wowote ulio chini.

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:13.360
Kwa hiyo tuliendesha kitanzi mara mbili, na

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:16.100
hilo ni jambo la muhimu kujua. Maadamu

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:18.320
tunaanza kwa sifuri na tuna

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:21.460
sharti la "ndogo kuliko", namba tunayoweka

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:23.780
hapo, mbili katika mfano huu, ni idadi

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:26.530
ya mara ambazo kitanzi kitaendeshwa. Kwa hiyo hii

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:28.900
ni sawa na kusema repeat mbili.

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:33.020
Kwa hiyo si vigumu, lakini ni ngumu

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:38.120
zaidi kuliko kuandika repeat mbili tu. Kitanzi kinachofuata

00:02:38.180 --> 00:02:40.380
kujifunza ni while kitanzi (yaani "wakati").

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:45.800
Hii inasema, "Wakati sharti fulani linatimizwa, endesha kitanzi."

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:47.190
Kwa hiyo tunaweza kuwa na sheria inayosema

00:02:47.190 --> 00:02:49.710
unaweza kupiga risasi mara tano tu katika Space

00:02:49.740 --> 00:02:52.130
Invaders. Hivyo tutakuwa na kitanzi hapa

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:54.170
kinachosema, basi, wakati idadi ya risasi iko chini

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:56.940
ya tano, endesha kitanzi kinachomruhusu mtu

00:02:56.960 --> 00:03:00.340
kucheza mchezo. Kila mtu anapopiga risasi,

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:04.000
tunaongeza numShots kwa moja, na hatimaye

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:06.040
tutafikia tano na kitanzi kitaacha kuendesha.

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:08.880
Sasa, shida moja ya vitanzi vya while ni kwamba

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:11.440
ni rahisi sana kupata hitilafu zinazosababisha

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:14.040
kitanzi kisiishe kamwe. Na hivi huitwa

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:15.890
vitanzi visivyo na mwisho, na ni mojawapo ya

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:20.010
hitilafu zinazojitokeza mara nyingi zaidi katika programu. Kompyuta yako

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:23.020
inapopungua kasi, mafeni yanaanza kuzunguka, kila kitu kinakuwa na kelele,

00:03:23.060 --> 00:03:25.860
mara nyingi hiyo ni kwa sababu mtu ameacha kitanzi kisicho na mwisho

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:29.380
ambacho hakiishi kamwe kwenye msimbo wake. Sawa,

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:32.280
keyword mbili zaidi katika video hii ya haraka. Ya

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:35.300
kwanza ni keyword break. Unaweza kuitumia

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:37.680
popote ndani ya mwili wa kitanzi chochote.

00:03:38.760 --> 00:03:40.720
Sehemu iliyo kati ya mabano ya kukunja, hiyo ndiyo

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:43.840
mwili. Na Jiki atakapoiona, atatoka

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:46.100
kwenye kitanzi mara moja na kuendelea

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:48.780
na msimbo wowote ulio chini ya kitanzi. Kwa hiyo,

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:50.600
ikiwa tuna hitaji linalosema endesha

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:53.280
kitanzi hiki mara 50, lakini tunataka kusimama

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:55.960
ikiwa mtumiaji amepiga risasi mara tano, tunaweza

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.140
kuwa na for kitanzi juu

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:00.940
kinachosema kuanzia i = 0 hadi chini ya

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:03.300
50. Lakini basi tunaweza kuwa na sharti

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:04.720
katikati ya kitanzi linalosema

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:07.720
kama numShots ni kubwa kuliko au sawa na

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:12.520
tano, basi break, yaani simamisha kitanzi. Kuna

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:14.880
nyakati ambazo tunaweza kutaka kuruka

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:18.600
marudio fulani ya kitanzi badala yake. Fikiria

00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:20.780
tunataka kufanya mambo kwa namba witiri pekee.

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:22.930
Tunataka kuweza kusema: kama

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:25.780
i ni namba witiri, usiendeshe kitanzi

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:28.380
wakati huu. Lakini hatutaki kutoka kabisa

00:04:28.420 --> 00:04:30.280
kwenye kitanzi. Tunataka tu kuruka

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:32.670
marudio haya moja, kisha tuangalie

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:35.600
yanayofuata. Na kwa hili, tuna

00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:40.380
keyword nyingine inayoitwa continue. Jiki anapoona continue,

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:42.180
anaruka tu hadi mwanzo wa

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:44.820
kitanzi kwa marudio yanayofuata. Kwa hiyo katika

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:47.200
kitanzi cha for of, akiona continue,

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:48.580
anaendelea hadi kipengele kinachofuata katika

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:51.780
orodha. Katika for kitanzi, anapitia

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:54.400
hatua ya nyongeza ya i++ kisha

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:57.980
anaanza marudio yanayofuata. Kwa hiyo sasa tuna

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:00.800
vitanzi vya for, vitanzi vya while, break na continue. Kuna taarifa nyingi

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:02.440
katika video hii, lakini unaweza kurudi

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:04.550
na kuiangalia wakati wowote unaotaka, na

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:07.080
pia kuna kurasa za dhana kwa kila mada.

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:09.800
Jaribu kutumia mawazo hayo yote kivitendo katika

00:05:09.820 --> 00:05:12.220
mazoezi machache yajayo. Kila la heri, furahia,

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:14.060
na tutaonana hapa tena hivi karibuni.
